## 📊 API Endpoints

### **Participant Endpoints**
```
GET    /Participant/Index              - View all participants
POST   /Participant/Register           - Register new participant
GET    /Participant/Details/{id}       - Get participant details
GET    /Participant/GetAllSkills       - Get all skills
GET    /Participant/GetCategories      - Get skill categories
```

### **Team Endpoints**
```
GET    /Team/Index                     - View all teams
POST   /Team/CreateTeam                - Create new team
POST   /Team/RunClustering             - Run clustering algorithm
POST   /Team/MoveParticipant           - Move participant between teams
POST   /Team/LockTeam                  - Lock a team
POST   /Team/UnlockTeam                - Unlock a team
GET    /Team/AuditLogs                 - View audit logs
```

### **Dashboard Endpoints**
```
GET    /Dashboard/Index                - Dashboard home
GET    /Dashboard/FilterBySkill        - Filter participants by skill
GET    /Dashboard/ExportParticipants   - Export participants CSV
GET    /Dashboard/ExportTeams          - Export teams CSV
GET    /Dashboard/ExportAuditLog       - Export audit log CSV
GET    /Dashboard/GetStats             - Get statistics JSON
```

